1
00:00:02,549 --> 00:00:06,753
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

2
00:00:08,121 --> 00:00:09,489
Mm...that was good.

3
00:00:10,123 --> 00:00:11,291
Now I need to find a sink.

4
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:13,193
My hands have cheese powder on them.

5
00:00:13,193 --> 00:00:16,863
I can't just wipe them off on somebody
else's labcoat like I normally do.

6
00:00:16,863 --> 00:00:20,467
Well, I could use the dead guy's
labcoat, but that's not sanitary.

7
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:22,936
Feeling up dead people
is how you get germs.

8
00:00:23,503 --> 00:00:24,671
Where am I going?

9
00:00:25,305 --> 00:00:26,873
I guess I'll check out that office.

10
00:00:27,841 --> 00:00:29,977
Oh!  Is that a shotgun?

11
00:00:30,377 --> 00:00:33,981
Who keeps a shotgun
and extra ammo in their office?

12
00:00:33,981 --> 00:00:35,482
That's hardcore.

13
00:00:36,683 --> 00:00:38,418
Who's the sheriff now?

14
00:00:39,419 --> 00:00:40,053
YEAH!

15
00:00:41,855 --> 00:00:43,523
I could do this all day.

16
00:00:45,592 --> 00:00:47,761
I need to find some more stuff to shoot.

17
00:00:47,761 --> 00:00:51,064
Shooting the bodies would look cool, but
I don't want to get that stuff on me.

18
00:00:51,064 --> 00:00:52,766
Oh, what about that locked door?

19
00:00:52,766 --> 00:00:55,068
I'll make a new door with this baby.

20
00:00:55,068 --> 00:00:56,770
Call me Ali Baba!

21
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:57,971
Open sesame!

22
00:01:01,541 --> 00:01:03,243
Fine then!  Close sesame!

23
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:06,346
Man, three rounds of
buckshot point blank.

24
00:01:06,346 --> 00:01:07,547
What the hell?

25
00:01:07,547 --> 00:01:09,983
It's like one of those
doors from Looney Tunes

26
00:01:09,983 --> 00:01:13,086
where they blow up the whole
building but the door's still standing.

27
00:01:13,086 --> 00:01:16,156
I bet it's locked on both sides
and nobody has the key.

28
00:01:17,457 --> 00:01:19,359
Let's see, can I climb up this?

29
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:22,295
I don't think I can.
Those edges are slanted.

30
00:01:22,295 --> 00:01:24,931
So, even if I could reach it,
I'd just slide right off.

31
00:01:24,931 --> 00:01:28,101
You'd think they don't want people
climbing the elevator shaft.

32
00:01:28,101 --> 00:01:29,369
Well, there's a ladder.

33
00:01:29,369 --> 00:01:31,371
I could-- I can jump that.

34
00:01:31,371 --> 00:01:33,106
I'm going to need a
running start, though.

35
00:01:33,106 --> 00:01:35,675
This right here is why you
should eat Wheaties in the morning.

36
00:01:35,675 --> 00:01:39,913
I guess any breakfast is better for you
than the two shots of vodka I had.

37
00:01:39,913 --> 00:01:41,581
Whatever, let's do this.

38
00:01:41,581 --> 00:01:43,450
Hoogasaka hoogasaka hoo!

39
00:01:43,917 --> 00:01:45,285
Oh shit, oh shit, oh shi--!

40
00:01:46,586 --> 00:01:48,688
HEV activated.

41
00:01:48,688 --> 00:01:52,225
Automatic medical systems engaged.

42
00:01:52,225 --> 00:01:54,594
Major fracture detected.

43
00:01:54,594 --> 00:01:57,197
Internal bleeding detected.

44
00:01:57,197 --> 00:02:01,200
Emergency: User death imminent.

